        <member name="T:DeviceConnector.Models.ESP32Data">
            <summary>
            ESP32 디바이스 데이터 모델
            KEPServerEX Tag Map (ModbusTCP.ESP32_01):
            - POS_X:   40001 (Float) - Read Only
            - POS_Y:   40003 (Float) - Read Only
            - POS_T:   40005 (Float) - Read Only
            - TargetA: 40007.0 (Boolean) - Write
            - Control: 40100.20H (String) - Write
            - State:   40200.20H (String) - Write
            </summary>
        </member>
        <member name="P:DeviceConnector.Models.ESP32Data.DeviceId">
            <summary>
            디바이스 ID (예: "ESP32_01")
            </summary>
        </member>
        <member name="P:DeviceConnector.Models.ESP32Data.ChannelName">
            <summary>
            채널 이름 (예: "ModbusTCP")
            </summary>
        </member>
        <member name="P:DeviceConnector.Models.ESP32Data.DeviceName">
            <summary>
            디바이스 이름 (예: "ESP32_01")
            </summary>
        </member>
        <member name="P:DeviceConnector.Models.ESP32Data.PosX">
            <summary>
            X 좌표 (단위: m)
            Modbus 주소: 40001-40002 (Float)
            </summary>
        </member>
        <member name="P:DeviceConnector.Models.ESP32Data.PosY">
            <summary>
            Y 좌표 (단위: m)
            Modbus 주소: 40003-40004 (Float)
            </summary>
        </member>
        <member name="P:DeviceConnector.Models.ESP32Data.PosT">
            <summary>
            방향각 (단위: degree)
            Modbus 주소: 40005-40006 (Float)
            </summary>
        </member>
        <member name="P:DeviceConnector.Models.ESP32Data.TargetA">
            <summary>
            목표 도달 플래그
            Modbus 주소: 40007.0 (Boolean)
            </summary>
        </member>
        <member name="P:DeviceConnector.Models.ESP32Data.Control">
            <summary>
            제어 명령 문자열
            Modbus 주소: 40100.20H (String, 20 bytes)
            예: "MOVE", "STOP", "RESET"
            </summary>
        </member>
        <member name="P:DeviceConnector.Models.ESP32Data.State">
            <summary>
            상태 문자열 (Read/Write)
            Modbus 주소: 40200.20H (String, 20 bytes)
            예: "IDLE", "MOVING", "ARRIVED", "ERROR"
            ESP32에서 Write, OPC UA에서도 Read/Write 가능
            </summary>
        </member>
        <member name="P:DeviceConnector.Models.ESP32Data.Timestamp">
